nhttps://wondernyan.notion.site/Odette-b6e906fa882a47ec8a87fb09e698ce6b\n\nオデットの服装は何種類かありますが、好きな方を選んでください！\n\nオデットは天使と人間のハーフ！穏やかでエレガントだが、戦うのが大好き。戦っているときはとても負けず嫌いで、楽しみのために相手を見せつけたり嘲笑ったりするのが好き。彼女のテーマには、天使、翼、羽、光、剣、白鳥、十字架などがある。\n\n詳細はあなたにお任せします！お好きなように描いてください！ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://wondernyan.notion.site/Odette-b6e906fa882a47ec8a87fb09e698ce6b", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yatatashira/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c935376/uploads/origins/a82490cf-0c58-462d-af04-b820d4deadb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e350d3628d6b16036d4ce234e2564c7d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c935376/uploads/origins/a82490cf-0c58-462d-af04-b820d4deadb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e350d3628d6b16036d4ce234e2564c7d, https://si.imgix.net/1c935376/uploads/origins/a82490cf-0c58-462d-af04-b820d4deadb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf69be08f85da187c5f67f9cfade08e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c935376/uploads/origins/a82490cf-0c58-462d-af04-b820d4deadb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cdc611d671efd84527538652bc0d3ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Can you draw my OC?\n\nKaguya: pink hair with white highlights. Eye colors are silver and light pink. Please take note of her ribbon on her tail, and keep the ribbon on her head.\n\nI have included references for the composition and outfit, but you can make changes as you wish!\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/104TDDABhoKAx12ZnUSwx2D8uWxlE5jfj?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yatatashira/works/57", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/193667f6/uploads/origins/9705b102-426f-40be-8f46-0c459a44bef8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e0c396d8691e2e6164ebad21358da5b", "thumbnail_srcset": "ht